<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: gather honey -->
  <VV_GatherHoney.label>收獲蜂蜜</VV_GatherHoney.label>
  <!-- EN: Gather honey from mature flowers or fruit trees. The speed and yield of honey gathering must be greater than 0 to perform the job. Some arcane plants can also gather honey, but arcane plants do not produce pollen.\n\nIf the worker's plant skill is low, they may damage gathered plant. -->
  <VV_GatherHoney.description>從成熟的花或是果樹上收集蜂蜜。蜂蜜采集速度和產量必須大于0才能執行此任務。一些神秘植物也會產出蜂蜜，但其不會產生花粉。\n\n如果工作者種植技能過低，可能會損壞采集的植物。</VV_GatherHoney.description>
  <!-- EN: Gathering honey. -->
  <VV_GatherHoney.jobString>收獲蜂蜜中</VV_GatherHoney.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: gather living leaf -->
  <VV_GatherLivingLeaf.label>收獲活葉</VV_GatherLivingLeaf.label>
  <!-- EN: Gather rare living leaves from arcane plants. The speed and yield of living leaf gathering must be greater than 0 to perform the job, and it takes a significant amount of time to gather.\n\nIf the worker's plant skill is low, they may damage gathered plant. -->
  <VV_GatherLivingLeaf.description>從神秘植物中收集稀有的活葉。活葉的采集速度和產量必須大于0才能進行這項工作，采集需要大量時間。\n\n如果工作者種植技能過低，可能會損壞采集的植物。</VV_GatherLivingLeaf.description>
  <!-- EN: Gathering living leaves. -->
  <VV_GatherLivingLeaf.jobString>收獲活葉中</VV_GatherLivingLeaf.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: gather propolis -->
  <VV_GatherPropolis.label>采集蜂膠</VV_GatherPropolis.label>
  <!-- EN: Gather rare propolis from surrounding trees. The speed and yield of propolis gathering must be greater than 0 to perform the job, and it takes a significant amount of time to gather.\n\nIf the worker's plant skill is low, they may damage gathered plant. -->
  <VV_GatherPropolis.description>從周圍的樹上采集稀有的蜂膠。蜂膠采集速度和產量必須大于0才能執行此任務，采集需要大量時間。\n\n如果工作者種植技能過低，可能會損壞采集的植物。</VV_GatherPropolis.description>
  <!-- EN: Gathering propolis. -->
  <VV_GatherPropolis.jobString>采集蜂膠中</VV_GatherPropolis.jobString>
  
</LanguageData>